# Nothing here belongs in the image. The Dockerfile copies `src` and
# `schema.sql` and installs from the lock, so the rest is build-context weight:
# a virtualenv and a downloaded model that the image builds its own, caches,
# and the suite, which runs on the host and never in the image.
.venv
__pycache__
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.fastembed
tests
